            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne omundu akhaana sisiaayo sibele tawe, sikila sili khale sia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ebeele ekhaafu namwe likheese sikila bili bia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ekhaafu eyo namwe sisiaayo siaaba ne sili sinyaalu aba alabikula khulwe bukusi bubwareebwao, ne khutasakho silala khu biraano sie bukusi bwayo. Yaba ne bikhasikulwa tawe, binyala biakusibwa khu mundu okundi khulwe bukusi bubwarebwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
