            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.22+DEU.14.23+DEU.14.24+DEU.14.25+DEU.14.26+DEU.14.27+DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 14.22-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Silala khu khumi, sie likesa lie bibiaamo bie kamaloba, yakhaba neli engaanu khukhwama mu mukuunda namwe kamatuunda khukhwama khu mirongooro bili bitakatifu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne aaba omundu ne enya khusikula silala khu khumi siewe, akhoya atasekho silala khu biraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne buli sitonyi sie likhumi sie chikhaafu ne kamakheese, biili asi wo mwayi, silaba sitakatifu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwene biaayo akharoboramo bilayi namwe biibi tawe. Namwe akhakaluukhasia akobosiao sisiindi tawe. Ne aakhola ario, aba bibiaayo bioombi bilaba bitakatifu. Ne aba se bilasikulwa tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
