          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kano kali kamalaka niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aelesia Musa khu sikulu sia Sinai khulwe babaandu ba Isiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
